## Decisions
- Implement the MCP server as a Node.js stdio server using `@modelcontextprotocol/sdk`.
- Expose a small set of tools:
  - `enderai_request`: generic REST request (method/path/query/body/headers) against a configured base URL.
  - `enderai_openapi`: fetch OpenAPI JSON.
  - `enderai_health_check`: hit the backend health check endpoint.
- Auth via env var `ENDERAI_BEARER_TOKEN` (never store tokens in repo).

## Implementation Notes
- Code lives in `mcp/enderai-api-mcp/` (Node + TypeScript).
- Tool results return a JSON string with `{ url, status, ok, contentType, data }`.

